## Code

```python title="train.py" lines hl="3,4"
def entrainer(modele, donnees, epochs=10):
    """Entraîne un modèle PyTorch."""
    for epoch in range(epochs):
        perte = modele.loss(donnees)
        print(f"Epoch {epoch+1}: perte={perte:.4f}")
    return modele
```

```rust
fn main() {
    let message: &str = "Bonjour RDTMD !";
    println!("{}", message);
}
```

```javascript
async function chargerDonnees(url) {
    const reponse = await fetch(url);
    const json = await reponse.json();
    console.log(`Chargé: ${json.length} éléments`);
    return json;
}
```

